      "sourceId": "corin_wickes-mindscape_4",
      "label": "Battlefield Retainer (Mindscape Cinema N°4)",
      "description": "When Corin uses a Quick Assist, Defensive Assist, or Chain Attack, she recovers 7.2 Energy. This effect can trigger once every 16s.",
