    },
    {
      "id": "corin_wickes-mindscape_6-acummulated_release",
      "source": "mindscape",
      "sourceId": "corin_wickes-mindscape_6",
      "label": "Accumulated Release (Mindscape Cinema N°6)",
      "description": "When Corin's extended slash hits an enemy, she obtains a stack of Charge (max 40 stacks). During a Dodge Counter, Special Attack, EX Special Attack, Quick Assist, or Assist Follow-Up, when her chainsaw detonation hits an enemy, consumes all stacks of Charge. Each stack consumed causes the attack to deal an additional 3% of ATK as DMG.",
